{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "sales.order.open payload",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": [
    "items"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "items": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "product_name",
          "price",
          "quantity"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "product_id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "product_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "product_sku": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "quantity": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "price": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "is_gift": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "unit_code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "unit_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "factor_num": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "factor_den": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "increment_value": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "price_quantity_value": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "pricing_unit_code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "pricing_unit_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "pricing_factor_num": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "pricing_factor_den": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "customer_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "source_module": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "description": "ADR-0141: abre un pedido MUTABLE (`order`, estado 'open') con sus líneas materializadas temprano. DINERO (`price`) = céntimos enteros (ADR-0007); `quantity` = PUNTO FIJO entero, escala global 10⁶ (ADR-0147): 0,5 kg es 500000. El contexto de unidades se CONGELA en la línea (§2.4) y fuera de la rejilla del incremento se RECHAZA (§2.2). Los importes del pedido abierto son PROVISIONALES (display); la cuota fiscal se congela al cobrar (`complete_sale`). NO acepta `table_id`: `sales` es agnóstico de la mesa (ADR-0141)."
}
